       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FINDMISSING.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 ARR.
           05 ARR-ITEM PIC 9(2) OCCURS 5 TIMES.
       01 N PIC 9(2) VALUE 6.
       01 I PIC 9(2).
       01 EXPECTED-SUM PIC 9(3).
       01 ACTUAL-SUM PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
       01 MISSING-VAL PIC 9(3).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 1 TO ARR-ITEM(1)
           MOVE 2 TO ARR-ITEM(2)
           MOVE 4 TO ARR-ITEM(3)
           MOVE 5 TO ARR-ITEM(4)
           MOVE 6 TO ARR-ITEM(5)
           COMPUTE EXPECTED-SUM = N * (N + 1) / 2
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 5
               ADD ARR-ITEM(I) TO ACTUAL-SUM
           END-PERFORM
           COMPUTE MISSING-VAL = EXPECTED-SUM - ACTUAL-SUM
           DISPLAY "MISSING: " MISSING-VAL
           STOP RUN.
